original_row.English:
If he left adult and minor sons—
if the adults improved the property,
they have improved for the common holding;96
if they97 said:
“See what our father has left us, we will labor and consume the profits,” they have improved for themselves.98
And similarly a wife who improved the property,
she has improved for the common holding;
If she said:
“See what my husband has left me, I will labor and consume the profits,”
she has improved for herself.

